{"code":"145995","name":"삼양사우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 2011년 삼양홀딩스에서 인적분할하여 설립되었으며, 삼양패키징, 삼양EP헝가리, 삼양EP베트남, 삼양에코테크, 삼양케이씨아이 등을 종속회사로 보유하고 있음. 2026년 미국과 일본에 현지법인을 신규 설립하여 글로벌 사업 확대를 추진하고 있음. 사업은 식품부문(설탕, 밀가루, 전분당, 유지)과 화학부문(엔지니어링 플라스틱, PET 용기, 이온교환수지, 퍼스널케어용 폴리머)으로 구성되어 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":30600.0,"open":30900.0,"high":30900.0,"low":30600.0,"volume":34,"amount":1040400.0,"ret_1d":-0.1631,"gap":0.8157,"range_pct":0.9804,"ret_5":-3.1646,"ret_20":-8.9286,"ret_60":-8.1081,"ret_120":-6.7073,"ret_250":-13.9241,"ma20":32112.5,"ma60":32755.8333,"ma120":32555.0,"ma200":33815.5,"close_vs_ma200":-9.509,"close_vs_ma60":-6.5815,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-18.5356,"r2_60":0.3843,"slope_120":1.6812,"r2_120":0.007,"slope_250":-16.169,"r2_250":0.625,"high52":38550.0,"low52":30000.0,"pos_52w":7.0175,"dd_52w":-20.6226,"mdd_1y":-20.9363,"atr14_pct":1.9608,"vol_ann_60":15.9661,"vol_avg20":651.3,"vol_ratio20":0.0522,"vr5":1.2237,"vr20":0.8154,"amount_avg5":16364030.0,"amount_avg20":20761105.0,"amount_avg60":14497287.5,"obv_chg20":-9.8726,"turnover_20":3.5199,"pv_eff_20":-2.5366,"rsi14":30.6877,"frgn_net_5":-2.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0005,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0005,"frgn_net_20":-7.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0019,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0019,"frgn_net_60":-33.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0089,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0089,"frgn_net_120":503.0,"inst_net_120":-3509.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.1359,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.9482,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.8123,"foreign_ratio":3.18,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-1.41,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":431.0,"op_margin_q":6.1091,"op_qoq":104.2654,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":11.9481,"rev_yoy":4.7047,"op_trend_4q":8.6496,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-17.89,"debt_ratio":127.21,"per":null,"pbr":0.19,"div_yield":5.88,"foreign_rate":